                                      <a href="/alerts/apple-pilots-live-notes-ai-to-transcribe-genius-bar-visits" rel="noopener" class="dash__story-headline">Apple pilots AI that records Genius Bar chats</a>
                        <div class="dash__story-sum">Bloomberg&#039;s Mark Gurman reports Apple is piloting an AI system called &#039;Live Notes&#039; in some stores that uses an iPad to record and transcribe conversations between Genius Bar employees and customers, then attach the summary to the repair record. Both the employee and customer must opt in, recordings are not saved, and managers cannot access transcripts. The same newsletter also examines why Apple&#039;s OpenAI trade-secrets suit stopped short of naming Jony Ive.</div>          </div>
                  <div class="dash__story" data-beat="builders">
