                        <div class="dash__story-sum">Andrew Hill reports that AI is reshaping entry-level professional services roles — with firms redesigning hiring pipelines, training programs and workplace culture rather than simply cutting junior headcount. Story appeared on Techmeme&#039;s front page today. Article body could not be fetched from ft.com for grounding.</div>          </div>
