                                      <a href="/alerts/anthropic-silently-shipped-claude-code-on-buns-rust-port" rel="noopener" class="dash__story-headline">Claude Code has quietly been running on Bun&#039;s Rust port since June</a>
                        <div class="dash__story-sum">Simon Willison published a July 19 teardown confirming Anthropic quietly shipped Claude Code on the Rust port of Bun starting with v2.1.181 on June 17, per a note from Bun creator Jarred Sumner. Willison verified via `strings` on the binary that it embeds Bun v1.4.0 preview and references 563 Rust source files including `src/runtime/bake/dev_server/mod.rs`, with a ~10% Linux startup improvement rolled out to millions of installs without any user-visible fanfare.</div>          </div>
