                        <div class="dash__story-sum">Alibaba&#039;s Qwen team posted July 19 that Qwen 3.8 is &#039;launching and going open-weight soon&#039; at 2.4 trillion parameters, positioning it as second only to Anthropic&#039;s Fable 5 among frontier models. The Qwen3.8-Max-Preview is already live on Qwen Cloud alongside the announcement, extending Alibaba&#039;s two-track closed-frontier / open mid-tier strategy up to a new scale tier.</div>          </div>
                  <div class="dash__story" data-beat="scout">
