                                      <a href="https://minimaxir.com/2026/07/agent-quota-reset/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dash__story-headline">Codex reset weekly quota six times in two weeks, users annoyed</a>
                        <div class="dash__story-sum">Max Woolf (minimaxir) argues in a July 18 essay that OpenAI has reset Codex weekly quotas six times between July 9 and 17, and that similar unpredictable resets from Anthropic and OpenAI are backfiring — power users on $100+ plans feel their existing quota is &#039;wasted&#039; rather than rewarded. Woolf ties the reset frequency to July&#039;s Fable 5 and GPT-5.6 Sol launches, arguing labs are trying to retain users from experimenting with competitors and could instead push power users to downgrade plans.</div>          </div>
