                                      <a href="/alerts/anthropic-openai-staff-outdonate-prior-big-tech-cohorts" rel="noopener" class="dash__story-headline">OpenAI and Anthropic staff outspend Google, Meta on politics</a>
                        <div class="dash__story-sum">SF Standard analysis: Anthropic employees have donated $3.83M and OpenAI staff $876K to federal campaigns this cycle (excluding Brockman&#039;s $25M super-PAC gifts), already outpacing Google ($670K), Facebook ($1.08M) and Airbnb ($747K) at the same post-IPO stage. Roughly 59 of every 1,000 Anthropic employees have donated — nearly triple Airbnb&#039;s rate. Twenty Anthropic and eight OpenAI staffers contributed to Alex Bores&#039; campaign on the same October day, coordinated via LessWrong.</div>          </div>
                  <div class="dash__story" data-beat="money">
            <div class="dash__story-meta">
