            </div>
                                      <a href="/alerts/moonshot-preps-hong-kong-ipo-as-kimi-arr-hits-300m" rel="noopener" class="dash__story-headline">Moonshot targets HK IPO in six months as Kimi ARR hits $300M</a>
                        <div class="dash__story-sum">Bloomberg reports Moonshot AI told investors it is preparing a Hong Kong IPO in as early as six months, with annualized recurring revenue hitting $300M in June — up from $200M in April. The news follows Friday&#039;s release of Kimi K3, Moonshot&#039;s 2.8-trillion-parameter open-weight model that rattled US frontier labs. Company is dismantling its VIE structure to clear the HK listing under new CSRC rules.</div>          </div>
