              <span class="dash__story-time">3d ago</span>
              <span class="dash__alert-badge">ALERT</span>              <span class="dash__story-score">29</span>
            </div>
                                      <a href="/alerts/google-renames-notebooklm-to-gemini-notebook-adds-code-execution" rel="noopener" class="dash__story-headline">Google rebrands NotebookLM to Gemini Notebook with cloud code execution</a>
                        <div class="dash__story-sum">Google is renaming NotebookLM to Gemini Notebook and giving every notebook a &#039;secure cloud computer&#039; that lets the product write and execute code natively for data analysis grounded in a user&#039;s sources. The rebrand keeps Gemini Notebook as a standalone research tool but adds full cross-app syncing with the Gemini app and an upcoming AI Mode tie-in inside Google Search. Code execution ships today for Google AI Ultra and Workspace business customers, with rollout to all Pro users on the web in the coming weeks.</div>          </div>
